{"id":"0ac4b9a122d458e2","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-structure.md","title":"结构","display":"df-structure — 结构","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-structure","aliases":["29-df-structure"],"display":"df-structure — 结构","depends_on":["[[29-df-vocab]]"],"revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-structure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-structure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-structure — 结构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-structure-—-结构-$\\mathfrak{A}$\">df-structure — 结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau = \\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)},c_1,\\ldots,c_s,f_1^{(r_1)},\\ldots,f_t^{(r_t)}\\rangle \\in \\mathrm{Vocabulary}\">\\(\\tau = \\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)},c_1,\\ldots,c_s,f_1^{(r_1)},\\ldots,f_t^{(r_t)}\\rangle \\in \\mathrm{Vocabulary}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}[\\tau]\\)</span> 在本条作为元语言可定义结构类使用；载体遍历非空集合，不声称全体结构构成一个集合。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\subseteq\\tau\">\\(\\sigma\\subseteq\\tau\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}[\\tau]\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}[\\tau]\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho=(P_1^{(k_1)},\\ldots,P_m^{(k_m)})\">\\(\\rho=(P_1^{(k_1)},\\ldots,P_m^{(k_m)})\\)</span> 是互异关系符号元组，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_i\\subseteq|A|^{k_i}\">\\(X_i\\subseteq|A|^{k_i}\\)</span>；原已存在的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_i\">\\(P_i\\)</span> 必须具有同一元数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 为满足所列条件的唯一对象定描述符。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{Struct}[\\tau] \\coloneqq \\left\\{\\mathfrak{A}=\\left\\langle |\\mathfrak{A}|,R_1^{\\mathfrak{A}},\\ldots,R_r^{\\mathfrak{A}},c_1^{\\mathfrak{A}},\\ldots,c_s^{\\mathfrak{A}},f_1^{\\mathfrak{A}},\\ldots,f_t^{\\mathfrak{A}}\\right\\rangle \\middle| \\begin{array}{l} |\\mathfrak{A}|\\neq\\emptyset,\\\\ \\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}\\;(R_i^{\\mathfrak{A}}\\subseteq |\\mathfrak{A}|^{a_i}),\\\\ \\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,s\\}\\;(c_j^{\\mathfrak{A}}\\in |\\mathfrak{A}|),\\\\ \\forall k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,t\\}\\;(f_k^{\\mathfrak{A}}:|\\mathfrak{A}|^{r_k}\\to |\\mathfrak{A}|) \\end{array}\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{Struct}[\\tau] \\coloneqq \\left\\{\\mathfrak{A}=\\left\\langle |\\mathfrak{A}|,R_1^{\\mathfrak{A}},\\ldots,R_r^{\\mathfrak{A}},c_1^{\\mathfrak{A}},\\ldots,c_s^{\\mathfrak{A}},f_1^{\\mathfrak{A}},\\ldots,f_t^{\\mathfrak{A}}\\right\\rangle \\middle| \\begin{array}{l} |\\mathfrak{A}|\\neq\\emptyset,\\\\ \\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}\\;(R_i^{\\mathfrak{A}}\\subseteq |\\mathfrak{A}|^{a_i}),\\\\ \\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,s\\}\\;(c_j^{\\mathfrak{A}}\\in |\\mathfrak{A}|),\\\\ \\forall k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,t\\}\\;(f_k^{\\mathfrak{A}}:|\\mathfrak{A}|^{r_k}\\to |\\mathfrak{A}|) \\end{array}\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\upharpoonright\\sigma\\coloneqq\\iota B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}[\\sigma]\\;\\bigl(|B|=|A|\\land\\forall P\\in\\operatorname{Sym}(\\sigma)\\;P^B=P^A\\bigr),\\qquad A\\upharpoonright_\\sigma\\coloneqq A\\upharpoonright\\sigma.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\upharpoonright\\sigma\\coloneqq\\iota B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}[\\sigma]\\;\\bigl(|B|=|A|\\land\\forall P\\in\\operatorname{Sym}(\\sigma)\\;P^B=P^A\\bigr),\\qquad A\\upharpoonright_\\sigma\\coloneqq A\\upharpoonright\\sigma.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A[\\rho:=\\bar X]\\coloneqq\\iota B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}[\\tau\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\rho)]\\;\\left(|B|=|A|\\land\\bigwedge_{i=1}^m P_i^B=X_i\\land\\forall P\\in\\operatorname{Sym}(\\tau)\\setminus\\operatorname{rng}(\\rho)\\;P^B=P^A\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A[\\rho:=\\bar X]\\coloneqq\\iota B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}[\\tau\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\rho)]\\;\\left(|B|=|A|\\land\\bigwedge_{i=1}^m P_i^B=X_i\\land\\forall P\\in\\operatorname{Sym}(\\tau)\\setminus\\operatorname{rng}(\\rho)\\;P^B=P^A\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A[P:=X]\\coloneqq A[(P):=(X)],\\qquad A[\\rho:=\\langle\\rangle]\\coloneqq A\\quad(m=0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A[P:=X]\\coloneqq A[(P):=(X)],\\qquad A[\\rho:=\\langle\\rangle]\\coloneqq A\\quad(m=0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本次来源边界：以上原书定位与过往核对叙述继承自所给文件，不表示本次重新查看了原书或完成机器证明；本次修补以现有文本的类型、条件和依赖闭合为依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-structure-—-结构-$\\mathfrak{A}$","text":"df-structure — 结构 $\\mathfrak{A}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-vocab]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau = \\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)},c_1,\\ldots,c_s,f_1^{(r_1)},\\ldots,f_t^{(r_t)}\\rangle \\in \\mathrm{Vocabulary}$ (see [[29-df-vocab]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak{A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau = \\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)},c_1,\\ldots,c_s,f_1^{(r_1)},\\ldots,f_t^{(r_t)}\\rangle \\in \\mathrm{Vocabulary}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\subseteq\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho=(P_1^{(k_1)},\\ldots,P_m^{(k_m)})","display":false},{"tex":"X_i\\subseteq|A|^{k_i}","display":false},{"tex":"P_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{Struct}[\\tau] \\coloneqq \\left\\{\\mathfrak{A}=\\left\\langle |\\mathfrak{A}|,R_1^{\\mathfrak{A}},\\ldots,R_r^{\\mathfrak{A}},c_1^{\\mathfrak{A}},\\ldots,c_s^{\\mathfrak{A}},f_1^{\\mathfrak{A}},\\ldots,f_t^{\\mathfrak{A}}\\right\\rangle \\middle| \\begin{array}{l} |\\mathfrak{A}|\\neq\\emptyset,\\\\ \\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}\\;(R_i^{\\mathfrak{A}}\\subseteq |\\mathfrak{A}|^{a_i}),\\\\ \\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,s\\}\\;(c_j^{\\mathfrak{A}}\\in |\\mathfrak{A}|),\\\\ \\forall k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,t\\}\\;(f_k^{\\mathfrak{A}}:|\\mathfrak{A}|^{r_k}\\to |\\mathfrak{A}|) \\end{array}\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"A\\upharpoonright\\sigma\\coloneqq\\iota B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}[\\sigma]\\;\\bigl(|B|=|A|\\land\\forall P\\in\\operatorname{Sym}(\\sigma)\\;P^B=P^A\\bigr),\\qquad A\\upharpoonright_\\sigma\\coloneqq A\\upharpoonright\\sigma.","display":true},{"tex":"A[\\rho:=\\bar X]\\coloneqq\\iota B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}[\\tau\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\rho)]\\;\\left(|B|=|A|\\land\\bigwedge_{i=1}^m P_i^B=X_i\\land\\forall P\\in\\operatorname{Sym}(\\tau)\\setminus\\operatorname{rng}(\\rho)\\;P^B=P^A\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"A[P:=X]\\coloneqq A[(P):=(X)],\\qquad A[\\rho:=\\langle\\rangle]\\coloneqq A\\quad(m=0).","display":true}],"bytes":2444,"backlinks":[{"id":"ac5c4072279f0088","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}[\\tau]$ 为任意非空结构，见 [[29-df-structure]]；不要求有限。"},{"id":"dd6d5729a326908a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"106187bc180d14ba","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\iota$ 为唯一对象定描述符；关系重解释 $A[R:=X]$ 取 [[29-df-structure]]。"},{"id":"37df1473b45d1ebc","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ad67d470dcdc91b8","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d8799e17a4ba0440","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"edcb3c1ba71c78c8","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9f21a81def92d642","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"75340800e8905793","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"98a7b2fe455fde6b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"10608c2a55a773a6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0de5e873dd7a7151","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3f8441c5cf2fdcc5","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书 Definition 4.13，印刷页 62，扫描页 77。对无额外参数的体，第一式与原来的 $\\min\\{i:R_i=R_{i+1}\\}$ 相同；增加对固定参数赋值取最大值，使 IND 中的资源界覆盖所有参数。最大值存在：相关参数赋值只有有限种，深度均为 $0,\\ldots,n^k$ 内的整数。非空结构约定来自 [[29-df-structure]]。"},{"id":"deaf0e86bfe2a066","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-structure]]、[[29-df-struc]] — 结构与有限结构类"},{"id":"3ee556c64b16809b","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak{A} \\in \\mathrm{Struct}[S]$ (see [[29-df-structure]])"},{"id":"5ea5b4fccf12f679","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}[S]$ 为任意非空模型类，$\\mathrm{STRUC}[S]$ 为有限模型类，见 [[29-df-structure]]、[[29-df-struc]]。"},{"id":"165874db46d8b664","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak{A}\\in\\mathrm{Struct}[\\tau]$ (see [[29-df-structure]])"},{"id":"76bbac386a4be5a3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"754d9a003ca52ced","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak{A}\\in\\mathrm{Struct}[S]$ (see [[29-df-structure]])"},{"id":"83f36b68a9cb059f","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D$ 为任意非空有限集合，$\\operatorname{flat}_{k,m,D}:(D^k)^m\\to D^{km}$ 以下式定义；$f[E]$ 为集合像。$B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\upsilon]$ 且 $|B|\\subseteq(D^k)^m$；$\\operatorname{Flat}_{k,m,D}^{\\upsilon}(B)$ 以下式作关系与常量的同时运输。$\\iota$ 仅用于唯一见证；结构类型见 [[29-df-structure]]、[[29-df-struc]]。"},{"id":"7f92cb4acad3757e","anchor":"ref-5","locat